// EXPECT-DIAG: E083
// EXPECT-DIAG: A deferred statement can't 'return'
// LANG-003 (docs/planning/ARCHITECTURE_OVERHAUL.md §8): "a deferred
// statement may not return, break, or continue out of itself" -- a
// `return` inside `defer` always escapes to the enclosing function, never
// "just" the defer, which is never what a reader expects from something
// spelled as ordinary cleanup code. Rejected at compile time
// (DeferControlFlowError, E083), raised by Resolver::visitDefer().
fn main(): int {
    defer return 5;
    return 0;
}
